translate Chinese strings:

    # game/script.rpy:429
    old "{size=16}{font=fonts/segoesc.ttf}{color=#45413c}{alpha=*0.6}I saw this intriguing article while I was researching online and it seemed like the kind of thing that you would enjoy. It is wonderful what you can find on the internet these days. It was tough to find the book but we were able to track down this volume second-hand, which the bookshop owner told us may be one of the only remaining copies! I hope that you will enjoy it. \n\nPlease give our best to your mum and dad and tell them that we are doing well here. The weather has been lovely.\n\nHappy birthday, [povname].\n\nLove Grandma and Grandpa.{/color}{/font}{/size}"
    new "{size=16}{font=fonts/segoesc.ttf}{color=#45413c}{alpha=*0.6}我在网上查资料时看到了这篇有趣的文章，心想你可能会喜欢。如今在互联网上能寻到的奇珍异宝真是令人惊叹。虽然这本书很难找，但我们总算淘到了这册二手书，书店老板告诉我们，这没准是世上仅存的孤本之一了！希望你能喜欢。\n\n请代我们向你爸妈问好，告诉他们我们在这里一切都好。最近天气十分宜人。\n\n生日快乐，[povname]。\n\n爱你的爷爷奶奶。{/color}{/font}{/size}"

    # game/script.rpy:1559
    old "\"The river rises, flows over its banks\n and carries us all away, like mayflies\nfloating downstream; they stare at the sun,\nthen all at once there is nothing.\\”\n-The Epic of Gilgamesh (Stephen Mitchell Translation)."
    new "“洪水泛滥，河水四溢，\n把我们悉数卷离，浮游在水上自在地游来漂去；\n它们晒着太阳甚惬意，顷刻间，一切都会化为乌有成子虚。”\n-吉尔伽美什史诗（拱玉书译本，有改动）。"

    # narrator_menu joins consecutive caption-only menu lines with a newline.
    old "A golden keyhole shone out from the closet door.\nThe sounds of the party echoed below you."
    new "壁橱门上的钥匙孔里，透出耀眼的金光。\n派对的声浪在你身下萦绕回荡。"

    old "Good evening, my light-fingered friend!"
    new "晚上好，我这位妙手空空的朋友！"

    old "He sprayed food as he spoke. He was sitting on a tower of pillows on his chair, so he could reach the table."
    new "他说话时唾沫横飞，嘴里的食物残渣四下飞溅。他在椅子上垫了一摞高高的靠枕，这才勉强够得着餐桌。"

    old "Don't worry about that little issue of the emerald brooch you made off with. A gentleman such as I has no need to worry about such trifles. Consider it a gift! A memento of our new friendship, hoho!"
    new "至于你顺走那枚祖母绿胸针的区区小事，千万别往心里去。像我这般体面的绅士，岂会在意这等微不足道的琐事。就当是我送你的礼物吧！权作咱们缔结新友谊的信物，嚯嚯！"


